From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 04:46:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix double tap seeking hanging, never rewrite .torrent files

- Double tap seeks fired one unclamped seek per tap from the current
  position: rapid taps flooded the engine and seeking before 0 or past
  the end left network files buffering forever. Taps now accumulate
  into a single clamped seek sent 350 ms after the last tap, with the
  offset and target time shown (-0:30   12:34). The forward tap also
  checked canSeekBackward instead of canSeekForward.
- A compressed local .torrent was decompressed in place, overwriting
  the user's file and leaving a tmp file next to it: it is now
  decompressed into the app cache.
---
 .../video/player/PlayerController.java        | 63 +++++++++++++------
 .../video/player/TorrentLoaderActivity.java   | 23 +++----
 2 files changed, 51 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-)

